  "title": "A Visit to the Music Room",
  "source": "original",
  "text": "Today my class went to visit the music room. A tiny robot sat on the table and played a tune. Our teacher said a spider had once made a web in the piano, so she checks it every Friday. My friend Diego tried to be the pilot of the toy rover parked nearby. We were silent as the music began, and even the youngest kids sat still to listen.",
